STATEMENT: >>>
An unsettled use case, narrower than WORK-UC-INNER-SDOCS-IN-CODE-COMMENTS:
once an inner sdoc inside a code comment is matched, extract it as a real
node rather than leaving it inert prose in a comment -- the same kind of
source-to-graph extraction WORK-CODE-LINKAGE-EXTRACTORS is already building
tree-sitter extractors for, just for sdoc-shaped content instead of Nix or
TypeScript.
